om/acidstorm2024-star","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T15:21:08Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T15:21:08Z","body":"Thanks for checking. No, in its current state this should be treated as a step toward restoring Web C# export support, not as a complete end-to-end fix yet.\n\nI updated the PR title/body to make that explicit and removed the implication that it closes #70796. The current branch adds the Web libgodot static-library build entrypoint, browser-wasm SDK wiring, and export-side packaging for the .NET browser publish output, but it still needs the remaining browser runtime/bootstrap validation before it should be considered mergeable as the full feature.\n\nI can keep iterating from here, or split this into smaller pieces if that would fit the review process better.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422068219/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422077323","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119405#issuecomment-4422077323","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119405","id":4422077323,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB5OLiw","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T15:22:06Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T15:24:59Z","body":"A solution would only be appropriate if it solves the problem completely, and it should absolutely not claim to close something if it doesn't, so it's good you removed that claim (especially considering you're trying to claim a bounty with this honesty is very important)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422077323/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422119914","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119405#issuecomment-4422119914","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119405","id":4422119914,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB5Qx6g","user":{"login":"acidstorm2024-star","id":283478051,"node_id":"U_kgDOEOWIIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283478051?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star","html_url":"https://github.com/acidstorm2024-star","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acidstorm2024-star/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T15:27:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T15:27:07Z","body":"I pushed a follow-up commit (`8379740`) that tackles the missing browser bootstrap path instead of leaving this as only packaging/build plumbing.\n\nWhat changed:\n- browser-wasm game exports now get an SDK-provided managed entry point (`BrowserMain.cs`)\n- the managed entry point starts the Web static library and drives `libgodot_web_iteration()` asynchronously\n- Web template Mono initialization now bypasses hostfxr/CoreCLR dynamic loading and binds directly to the generated `godotsharp_game_main_init` symbol that the browser-wasm linker should provide in the combined module\n- `libgodot_web_main()` was added as a Web static-library entry point for the managed host\n\nI still do not want to overstate validation: my local environment does not have `dotnet`, `scons`, or `emcc`, so I could only run static checks here. The intent of the new commit is to address the actual end-to-end bootstrap gap you called out, and I will keep iterating if CI or local Web/.NET toolchain validation exposes more issues.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422119914/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422135686","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119405#issuecomment-4422135686","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119405","id":4422135686,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB5Rvhg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-11T15:28:58Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T15:30:46Z","body":"Your commit seems not to be linked to your GitHub account. See: [Why are my commits linked to the wrong user?](https://docs.github.com/en/pull-requests/committing-changes-to-your-project/troubleshooting-commits/why-are-my-commits-linked-to-the-wrong-user) for more info.\r\n\r\n> I still do not want to overstate validation: my local environment does not have dotnet, scons, or emcc, so I could only run static checks here.\r\n\r\nThat's not good, I think it's not a good idea to try to make a change to the engine you can't test yourself, and please do not use CI as a substitute for testing locally, that's not what it is for","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422135686/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4422164824","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119405#issuecomment-4422164824","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119405","id":4422164824,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABB5ThWA","user":{"login":"Anutrix","id":11459028,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDU5MDI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11459028?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix","html_url":"https://github.com/Anutrix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Anutrix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"publi